{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1000_null", "source_sha256": "38f4ae37d64043003d3a4f7360979273ef13956153c63cce1dbee2d783aadfca", "ja": "音楽雑誌の撮影にて……", "zh": "在音乐杂志的拍摄现场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1001_camman", "source_sha256": "b161175d7f50f9970ce7c2eb3e5ffea003e86c477745f56b9ac6b7018818cc11", "ja": "いいですね、翼ちゃん。\n次は元気なポーズいってみましょう！", "zh": "很好，翼。\n接下来试试精神满满的姿势吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6184563e1c1f29cc4d173cd63aad24edb191b92531b31f8ec5ca9c988f37aa25", "ja": "は～い！　えっと、こんなカンジ？\nそれとも……こうですか～？", "zh": "好～！呃……像这样？\n还是说……这样吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1003_camman", "source_sha256": "9bc67205525d24943321f04a883e270dae80adf1127dfb411e4089024859549b", "ja": "おお！　すごくいいです、最高ですね！\nじゃあ今度は……。", "zh": "哦哦！非常棒，简直太好了！\n那么接下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1222711d625b87716e86a5e67c3baec0674fd7257e2b7361ad491988edcfe533", "ja": "ああ、楽しかった～♪\n……あ、プロデューサーさん！", "zh": "啊，真开心～♪\n……啊，制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ca37a689f752801151a3df7f7423377ab09d327a99431fe0f50be8fe93d5fd82", "ja": "お疲れ様で～す！\n撮影、ちゃんと見ててくれました～？", "zh": "辛苦啦～！\n刚才的拍摄，制作人有好好看着吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1007_406gsp", "source_sha256": "e8c1dd1edff45533f84b75986fc9dd6c982b2e60360ba0e837f8a622622cd72a", "ja": "お疲れ様。翼が、カメラマンさんの要求に\nすぐ対応してくれるから、予定より早く終わったよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。因为翼能立刻配合摄影师的要求，所以比预定时间更早结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "75a2942cffc30fecadd1313d8aa4cb76f68ee88b356d56e59bd4183f724f00f6", "ja": "えへへ～♪　だって、いっぱい褒めてくれるから\nわたしも楽しくなっちゃって。", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪ 因为摄影师一直夸我，我也不知不觉开心起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7e3f1431f0b744e15bc2f52d0305d7ce2809e737aa1d5cce47f065b679cf763c", "ja": "でもでも、雑誌に載る写真だから、\nちゃんと頑張ったんですよ！", "zh": "不过不过，因为是要登上杂志的照片，\n所以我可是认真努力了的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1010_406gsp", "source_sha256": "d64de005b56e9c2c8ca9ec6d1f42319eaa57fb553659b4e75c528e0d487a4347", "ja": "おお、偉いじゃないか。\nもしかして、ジュリアと瑞希の影響で……。", "zh": "哦，很了不起嘛。难道是因为受到了茱莉亚和瑞希的影响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "72c4ec6a9de33cd565f0ee0312ae1f2a4107dc1cd0fbcd7df3a5c6d0190e9447", "ja": "だって今回の雑誌が発売されたら、\nきっとわたし、モテモテになっちゃいますよね！", "zh": "因为这次的杂志一发行，\n我肯定会变得超级受欢迎吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6475b5990ad1f4be106aa6ea05f35cd18e273722c2d58fe9b8fd406474dd7692", "ja": "クラスのみんなだけじゃなくて、学校の先輩とかも！\nわたしのこと、ちやほやしてくれて……あっ！", "zh": "不只是班上的同学，就连学校里的学长学姐也会！  \n他们都会围着我转……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "86dd59b9cf3ca764c8fa3a50f3c1cd9e6cd15e91db6588a6010536551995aeb1", "ja": "音楽雑誌だから、バンドの人とかも見てくれますよね？\n番組でいきなり声かけられちゃったりして～。えへへ♪", "zh": "音乐杂志的话，乐队的人也会看到吧？说不定还会在节目里突然来跟我搭话呢～。诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1014_406gsp", "source_sha256": "7806efba18c2306a16d372b52df40dcc0922bbcae8eadb088a903f8f90b945da", "ja": "な、なるほど。全然関係なかったな……。\nとりあえず、順調に終わってよかった。", "zh": "原、原来如此。完全没关系啊……总之，能顺利结束就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1015_406gsp", "source_sha256": "63d3243799b144bdbc53deff7684fa8dcd0fa3670538e472131d7dbec74fda21", "ja": "さて、この後のインタビューはジュリアと瑞希と\n一緒だから、二人がくるまで休憩だ。", "zh": "好了，接下来的采访要和茱莉亚、瑞希一起，所以在两人来之前先休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b665aed43735ca5473d1355b21edcf0d2c6fbcd12d34a165fe7fff532ed5d663", "ja": "は～い。う～ん、インタビューか……。\n美希先輩、いつもどんなこと話してたっけ？", "zh": "好～。嗯～，采访啊……  \n美希前辈平时都聊些什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c5495cf032aa89757855aaa0ab256123d4146691e06281e8344b897a5f7a3084", "ja": "おにぎりとか、ネイルのこととか……あ、学校のこと？\nじゃあわたしも話してみようかな～♪", "zh": "饭团啦、美甲啦……啊，还有学校里的事？\n那我也试着聊聊看吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0533_1018_406gsp", "source_sha256": "252de5a76cee6708e5c5ddbec6ae2513c90ec06355e7f2fca06cc312d0b544e3", "ja": "（憧れに瞳を輝かせる姿が、実にまぶしい……。\nけどインタビュー内容は、後でチェックしないと！）", "zh": "（那双因憧憬而闪耀的眼眸，实在是太耀眼了……不过，采访内容得之后再确认才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
